Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Agent ke Home tab mein ek indicator hai — Sync Health.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.41,0:00:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Green matlab sab theek.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.87,0:00:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yellow matlab warning — jaise slow network ya large data queue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Red matlab problem — sync fail ho raha hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Right side mein details bhi milte hain last sync time next scheduled sync
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,aur pending vouchers count.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Agar Sync Health kuch din se yellow hai, ek baar manual Sync Now button dabaaein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually issue resolve ho jaata hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Red state mein, next video dekhiye — troubleshooting steps.
